event: thinking
data: {"id": "49aad98c702547c2-thinking-parallel_evidence-713", "run_id": "49aad98c702547c2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据采集结论\n\n### 已确认事实（支持根因）\n\n1. **Pod 状态为 Pending / ContainerCreating**：PromQL 返回 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`（reason=ContainerCreating），Phase 为 Pending。容器未启动，重启数为 0。\n\n2. **核心事件——ConfigMap 缺失**：Events 中明确记录了：\n   - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（x33 次，51 分钟内持续报错）\n   - `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]`（x20 次，49 分钟超时）\n\n3. **Pod Spec 验证**：YAML 确认 `volumes[0]` 定义了一个 ConfigMap 类型 volume，名称为 `unavailab", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788771589170, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "49aad98c702547c2-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "49aad98c702547c2", "seq": 714, "ts_ms": 1788771597433, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 36.217, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/49aad98c702547c2-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "8c9e26182d86428767136517aa9a5c04abdd37f7f844ccf83b8f52fbffda4347", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "1add09b252eb51cadd0d044b4a0334e3bebde3e789d9dd36047ae7a31c67d600"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "49aad98c702547c2-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "49aad98c702547c2", "seq": 715, "ts_ms": 1788771597433, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "49aad98c702547c2-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "49aad98c702547c2", "seq": 716, "ts_ms": 1788771603661, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 6.227, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1247, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.phase | `Pending` | 确认 Pod 未进入运行状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | event.message | `Warning FailedMount 6s (x33 over 51m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 提供确切的错误原因：Kubelet 因找不到 ConfigMap 挂载卷失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | container.resource_request.cpu | `5m` | 排除 CPU 资源不足导致调度的可能 |\n| 4 | K8s State | event.message | `Warning FailedMount 5m46s (x20 over 49m) kubelet Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]...` | 证实挂载失败是持续 50 分钟以上的阻塞性故障 |\n\n现有证据链完整：Pod YAML 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 持续失败，容器处于等待状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → 卷挂载初始化失败 (FailedMount) → 容器等待挂载完成 → Pod 保持 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n根因已确认：Pod Spec 中定义的非可选 ConfigMap volume `input` 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。\n\n这一配置错误直接导致了证据 [2] 和 [4] 中反复出现的 `FailedMount` 事件，Kubelet 无法完成卷挂载，因此容器无法启动，Pod 一直处于 `Pending` 状态（证据 [1]）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.phase | `Pending` | 确认 Pod 未进入运行状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | event.message | `Warning FailedMount 6s (x33 over 51m) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 提供确切的错误原因：Kubelet 因找不到 ConfigMap 挂载卷失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | container.resource_request.cpu | `5m` | 排除 CPU 资源不足导致调度的可能 |\n| 4 | K8s State | event.message | `Warning FailedMount 5m46s (x20 over 49m) kubelet Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]...` | 证实挂载失败是持续 50 分钟以上的阻塞性故障 |\n\n现有证据链完整：Pod YAML 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，导致 `MountVolume.SetUp` 持续失败，容器处于等待状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → 卷挂载初始化失败 (FailedMount) → 容器等待挂载完成 → Pod 保持 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n根因已确认：Pod Spec 中定义的非可选 ConfigMap volume `input` 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。\n\n这一配置错误直接导致了证据 [2] 和 [4] 中反复出现的 `FailedMount` 事件，Kubelet 无法完成卷挂载，因此容器无法启动，Pod 一直处于 `Pending` 状态（证据 [1]）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

